{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"109633","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/109633","key":"MC-239900","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"27/Oct/21 5:40 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n\n<p>If you open this custom world <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/144825\" title=\"21w42a-height4064.json attached to MC-239900\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"21w42a-height4064.json\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"d420fed4-8ff9-45e0-8d62-0ca0ad500360\" rel=\"noreferrer\">21w42a-height4064.json<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> in 21w43a after you generated it in 21w42a results in all terrain below -64 disappearing and any blocks being placed above 320 / max_y.<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"144826_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/144826\" title=\"image-2021-10-28-02-40-21-449.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"144826\" file-preview-title=\"image-2021-10-28-02-40-21-449.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/144826?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/144826\" filename=\"image-2021-10-28-02-40-21-449.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/144826\" data-attachment-name=\"image-2021-10-28-02-40-21-449.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"3b7f7dfb-dd13-42ac-a332-8f79702623e7\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open Minecraft in 21w42a</li>\n\t<li>Create a world using the custom world settings in <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/144825\" title=\"21w42a-height4064.json attached to MC-239900\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"21w42a-height4064.json\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"d420fed4-8ff9-45e0-8d62-0ca0ad500360\" rel=\"noreferrer\">21w42a-height4064.json<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span><br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Enter spectator mode, and observe that the world bottom is lower than Y=-64 and world top is higher than Y=320 (e.g. by placing a block above it)</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open Minecraft in 21w43a</li>\n\t<li>Play the world you created previously to upgrade it<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The terrain previously generated below Y=-64 has been removed, and the bottom of the world is now found at Y=-64. <br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Blocks above Y=320 are removed, and the top of the world is now found at Y=320</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehaviour\"></a>Expected behaviour</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>The upgraded world would not have all terrain below Y=-64 and above Y=320 removed, the dimension's bounding boxes / min_y and height should stay unchanged.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Error\"></a>Error</h3>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">Couldn't load chunk [11, -4]\njava.lang.ArrayIn